  "notes": "REC arg/adjunct classifier over LCCP arm-C. A=LCCP arm-C, B1=+categorial prior (bare-form + grounded place/time/manner), B2=+verb-diversity entropy. HARD_PASS = B1 suppresses >=50% of the bare-NP-adjunct target residual at recall-cost <=0.05 (structural signal succeeds where semantic gate failed). HARD_FAIL = recall cost >0.10 (trade-off bites) OR <15% reduced. Scope tag LOW_CEILING if the target residual is <15% of the 0.50 wall (corpus-sparse; rest = orthogonal quotative/prep/inversion/wrong-constituent modes). CLAIM-VET-pending; single-annotator gold (caveated); derived-arg GOAL tags spot-check-only."
